## Repo layout (single TanStack Start app at root)

Alias `~/` → `src/`.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `src/routes/` | File routes. Thin: load data via server functions, compose features. `routes/api/*`, `routes/auth/*`, `routes/photos.$.ts` are server routes |
| `src/features/` | UI per job (`<entity>-<objective>/`) and shared UI helpers |
| `src/components/` | Small shared presentational components (e.g. `Ladybird`) |
| `src/data/` | `<Entity>/*-dal.ts` (D1 queries) and `*-actions.ts` (server functions) |
| `src/domain/` | Business rules and pure logic — no I/O |
| `src/services/` | Environment, auth, payments, maps, notifications |
| `src/stores/` | Client stores (Nano Stores) |
| `src/utilities/` | Shared pure helpers |
| `tests/` | Vitest: pure domain tests and D1 integration tests (`getPlatformProxy`, throwaway state) |
| `migrations/` | D1 SQL, applied in filename order |

## Import law

Forbidden: domain → data/services. feature → sibling feature internals. Barrel `index.ts` re-exports. Vendor SDK imports outside `services/`.

Pages may compose multiple features. Business rules belong in `domain/` and get a test in `tests/`.

PR: correct layer, no forbidden imports, no new barrels, `pnpm check` passes.
